  "full_response": "**Chat Transcript: Bank Account Verification**\n\n---\n\n**Bank Agent (BA):** Hello! Thank you for contacting [Bank Name] Customer Support. My is Alex. How can I assist you today?\n\n**Customer (C):** Hi Alex, I need help with a transaction issue on my account.\n\n**BA:** I’d be happy to help with that. For security purposes, I’ll need to verify your account details. Could you please provide the following information?\n- Full name (as registered with the bank)\n- Account number\n- Routing number\n- Date of birth\n\n**C:** Sure, no problem.\n- Full name: Sarah Johnson\n- Account number: 1234567890\n- Routing number: 021000021\n- Date of birth: 05/15/1985\n\n**BA:** Thank you, Sarah. Let me verify these details. *Pause* Great, your account is verified. Now, could you please describe the transaction issue you’re experiencing?\n\n**C:** Thanks! I noticed a pending charge of $150 from an online store I don’t recognize. I’d like to dispute it.\n\n**BA:** I understand. I’ll flag this transaction for review and escalate it to our fraud team. They’ll contact you within 24-48 hours to investigate further. For security, I’ve also placed a temporary hold on your account to prevent any additional unauthorized transactions. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?\n\n**C:** That’s perfect—thank you so much for your help!\n\n**BA:** You’re welcome, Sarah! If you notice any other suspicious activity, don’t hesitate to reach out. Have a great day, and stay safe.\n\n**C:** You too! Bye.\n\n**BA:** Goodbye!\n\n---\n*End of chat*",
